# Build artifacts and staged downloads.
#
# Apollo's savepatch is deliberately NOT committed. It is GPL-3.0 (c) Damian
# Parrino and belongs to the Apollo project; tools/fetch_savepatch.py downloads
# and verifies it on demand instead. See that script's header for the reasoning.
#
# Our OWN patch IS committed: patches/BLUS30826.our.savepatch is this repo's
# work, built by tools/build_savepatch.py, so it is explicitly un-ignored below.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Git will not look inside an ignored directory, so patches/ is un-ignored and
# its CONTENTS ignored individually. Our own patch is then explicitly allowed.
patches/*
!patches/BLUS30826.our.savepatch
